"created_date": 1792423926, "id": "28881228868209487", "version": "0.87", "version_code": 87, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "28881221251543582"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7242557155836637", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28881228868209487"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1438346520109192"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1792170253, "id": "28842436362088738", "version": "0.86", "version_code": 86, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "28842429288756112"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7242557155836637", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28881228868209487"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1438346520109192"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1791841355, "id": "28786673484331693", "version": "0.78", "version_code": 78, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "28786668074332234"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7242557155836637", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28881228868209487"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1438346520109192"}]}, "change_log": "Crazy Golf VR 0.67 \u2014 everything since 0.60\n\nSmoother and sharper\n- Runs natively at up to 120 Hz on Quest 3 and 3S, with a sharper image.\n- Fewer first-time stutters as new areas and effects load.\n- Cleaner visuals across the courses: crisper ground around the ball, less flickering on overlapping surfaces, and less visible texture tiling at the volcano, cavern and canyon.\n- Trees and plants now sway in the wind.\n\nCreatures\n- Raptors now have health: it takes three plunger hits to drive one off, with hearts showing your progress.\n- New raptor combat animations, and raptor feet now plant firmly on the ground.\n- New raptor breeds: Crystal raptors in the Crystal Cavern, Alpine raptors in the mountains and Ember raptors at the volcano, each with their own idle behaviours.\n- Every course now has its own flying creature: the Crestwing, the Sailback, the Emberwing and the Geodewing.\n- Flying creatures lock on and swoop in more smoothly.\n- Defeated raptors now relax and go about their day instead of sulking.\n- Plungers stuck to raptors are easier to see.\n- A clearer impact and dazed recovery when a creature knocks you down.\n- Louder creature voices, and you can hear creatures coming.\n\nCourses\n- Sunken Sanctuary: ride the cliff tube, explore new column ruins and sink putts into carved reef and limestone cups.\n- Balls lost in rivers, creeks or the ocean now splash before returning.\n- The floating pause-menu course map shows lakes, rivers and the Sanctuary's seabed more faithfully.\n- Introduction: the awakening egg now glows gold.\n\nControls and comfort\n- Play with hand tracking or controllers. Set your controllers down to switch to hands.\n- Each hand keeps to its own tool: the club stays in your club hand and the plunger in the other.\n- Fall off a course and you return to where you last stood, not the start.\n- New Move Speed setting (2-6 m/s), with a slightly faster default.\n- Refreshed pause menu settings with easier sliders and page tabs.\n\nFeel and sound\n- Reworked haptics: subtler, crisper ball strikes, a gentle rolling feel and a distinct cue when your ball comes to rest.\n- Ball sounds now cut through the music, distant shots stay audible, and a perfectly struck shot has its own sound.\n- Music plays continuously and crossfades between tracks.\n\nAvatars and companions\n- Hats and visors fit avatars better.\n- The cat companion is bigger, walks more naturally and follows slopes properly.\n\nFixes\n- Fixed rocks on the mountain course that the ball could pass through.\n- Fixed the cat floating above hills.\n- Notifications no longer overlap the race display.", "created_date": 1791509108, "id": "28733088243023551", "version": "0.67", "version_code": 70, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "28733084353023940"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7242557155836637", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28881228868209487"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1438346520109192"}]}, "change_log": "What's new in 0.60\n\n\u2022 Sunken Sanctuary rebuilt: hyper tubes through the reef, a cliff tube, swimming reef raptors and diving stingrays.\n\u2022 New raptors everywhere, plus desert raptors in Sunscar Canyon. Two hits stun, the third drives them off.\n\u2022 Multiplayer: a results board and vote between courses, rejoin after a crash, and host handover.\n\u2022 Hand tracking: pinch to teleport, fist to hold the club, thumb down for the plunger.\n\u2022 Clubhouse: wardrobe, 13 achievements with name-tag titles, world-rank leaderboards and a music player.\n\u2022 Seated mode and height evening so every player can reach the ball.\n\u2022 Golden egg, woven nest, clearer distant beacons, and a stray line in the sky fixed.\n\u2022 Smaller download (about 1.3 GB), smoother first loads and relit worlds.", "created_date": 1791222546, "id": "28687937047538671", "version": "0.60", "version_code": 60, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "CHANGES_REQUESTED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "28687931024205940"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}